Witter Futures & Currency Management Inc. ("Dean Witter Futures & Currency
Management"). Prior to November 2000, Carr Futures Inc. ("Carr") provided
clearing and execution services to the Partnerships. Demeter, Morgan Stanley DW,
Morgan Stanley, Morgan Stanley International and Dean Witter Futures & Currency
Management are wholly-owned subsidiaries of Morgan Stanley Dean Witter & Co.



